the war for our axis has raged on across  deserts mountains and even Tundra but  now it's time to add some roses to your  guns and crank up your welcome to the  jungle the new continent of Hassan is  now available to planetside 2 players  plus it is covered in swamps and marshes  and evokes the feel of a murky bio a  constant haze limits your visibility  overgrowth gnarled roots and hollow logs  offer cover on the ground the terrain  features so much natural cover that  guerilla tactics become the law of the  land and limit the power of brute force  the canopies of the continents forests  add depth to aerial dogfights where  pilots are fighting the terrain as much  as they're fighting enemy pilots  the facilities now posts themselves are  not entirely completed and the continent  has been labeled with an early  expedition tag still the various bases  that have been completed display how far  the level design and planetside 2 has  evolved the new base layouts feature  better interaction between the placed  objects like floors and buildings as  well as meticulously crafted terrain  along with the new continents planetside  2 now features continents locking which  completely locks the continent from  other players being able to play on it  until a new continent is locked Conant's  may be locked by taking control of at  least ninety four percent of a comments  territory or by winning alerts which are  now focused entirely on one continent at  a time during a countenance lock the  Empire responsible for the lock gets a  surgeon power on the other continents  Hassan still has the interlink  facilities to come a new base type for  planetside 2 but a familiar name to  those who play the original planetside  outfits are also now able to recruit  through an in-game recruiting system and  can display outfit pride through  purchase details once a base is captured  the game displays the decal of the  outfit whose members contributed the  most scoring points in the basis capture  that's right now- gotta take over if  you've been looking for an excuse to get  back to contributing to the war effort  on our axis the launch of the hassan  continent is what you've been waiting  for the swamps and jungles of the  perfect chance to channel your inner  Rambo as you sneak through them to  rescue allies as a lone gorilla
 

